    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Matsugorou is a vile doctor who plots out a plan to take over the world by commanding his own robotic army. The only chance the world has is a group of three brothers that make up a team called the Emergengy Departure Saver Kids.",
        "jpn": "自身のロボット軍団を指揮して世界征服を企てる卑劣な医者、松五郎。世界に残された唯一のチャンスは、緊急脱出セイバーキッズと呼ばれるチームを構成する3人の兄弟のグループです。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Kinkyuu Hasshin Saver Kids"
    ],
